  "description": "<p>Range <strong>120ft</strong>; water in a square <strong>10ft</strong> per level on a side.</p><ul><li>Raise or lower the water level by <strong>2ft</strong> per level (max <strong>40ft</strong>) for <strong>10 minutes per level</strong>, after which it returns.</li><li>Lowering exposes the bed; raising lifts boats and floods low ground.</li><li>Creatures in the water are carried up or down without harm.</li><li>Does not affect water in living creatures.</li></ul><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Classes:</strong> Cleric</p>",
